    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Ashwood has been designed to take all the concerns of modern living on board.  Over three acres have been devoted to open space, green areas and walkways.  This unique river side and woodland development is an opportunity not to be missed. \r\n\r\nAshwood is situated in the charming town of Westport which is located beside the sea with Croagh Patrick as an impressive backdrop.  The town’s outstanding features include the beautiful tree-lined Mall along the Carrowbeg River and busy Bridge Street with its many shops, pubs and restaurants.  Westport also boasts many other wonderful attractions including:\r\n\r\n18 Hole Championship Golf Course\r\nBlue Flag beaches\r\nAward winning bars and restaurants\r\nA choice of swimming pools and leisure facilities\r\nNational Tidy Town awards winner\r\nDirect Rail link to Dublin\r\n\r\n\r\nProperty Type\r\n\r\n41 Ashwood Avenue is a 2 bedroom apartment which offers contemporary design and is finished to an extremely high standard.  It would make an ideal holiday home or investment property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Kitchen/Living room:   3.3m  x  7.8m                   1.1m  x  2.2m\r\nGood quality laminate floor.\r\nFitted kitchen.\r\nElectric fire.\r\nFrench door to large terrace.\r\nOverlooking Carrowbeg River.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1:           2.55m    x  3.80m\r\nLaminate floor.\r\nFrench door to large terrace.\r\nOverlooking Carrowbeg River.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2:     4.40m    x  2.65m\r\nLaminate floor.\r\nFronts onto green area and development entrance.\r\n\r\nBathroom:    2.50m    x  1.53m\r\nFully tiled.\r\nWC, WHB & electric Mira shower in enclosure.\r\n\r\nBalcony:\t\t\t\t5.8m  x  2m\r\n\r\nTotal Living Area: 57 sq. m (613 sq. ft.) approx excluding balcony"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Features:\r\nWalking distance to train station & Westport shopping area.\r\n800m to town centre.\r\nEasy access to Primary & secondary schools.\r\nGood quality laminate floors.\r\nLarge terrace overlooking Carrowbeg River.\r\nStorage heating."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C1 BER No.119088060"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "From Westport take the Ballinrobe Road passing the new Tesco Shopping Center, continue on for approximately 500 metres.  Ashwood is the development on the left hand side."
      }
